request.description:
Verifies the app is up.

Because `management.endpoint.health.show-details: always` is set, the response includes per-component detail — notably the `db` component. If `db` reports DOWN, the pgvector container on port 5433 is not reachable and every RAG call will fail.

Expected: 200 with {"status":"UP", "components": {...}}

